Dialog titles in the phone's script.

sdl2tk draws a toplevel's title bar itself, in DejaVu Sans, one
character at a time with no fallback, so a dialog titled in Japanese,
Chinese, Hindi or Amharic drew a row of boxes (emulator, 2026-10-01)
while the same words inside the dialog, which Tk draws, fell back to
the phone's Noto faces. A character the title font lacks is now drawn
in the first regular sans face that has it, at the title's size.

--- a/jni/sdl2tk/sdl/SdlTkInt.h
+++ b/jni/sdl2tk/sdl/SdlTkInt.h
